  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Human Security and Employability in Ba&#x2019;aj-Sinjar Border, Ninewa Governorate, Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will aim to build trust, strengthen community stability, encourage returns and reintegration for displaced population and returnees in Al Qataniya subdistrict of Ba&#x2019;aj district along the boarder with Sinjar, through conflict and gender sensitive interventions that enable resilient socio-economic recovery, reintegration, and peacebuilding</narrative>
  </description>
